        "caption": "Client Choice — real shelves, real carts",
        "body": [
          "Client Choice means the pantry works like a small grocery store: real aisles, fresh produce, dairy and proteins alongside the staples, and the dignity of choosing what your own family eats. Residents of Batavia and Batavia Township — including parts of Aurora and North Aurora — can shop once a month, or order online a day ahead and pick up at the counter."
        ],
        "bullets": [
          "Fresh produce, dairy & pantry staples",
          "Order online 24 hours ahead — staff will schedule your pick-up",
          "Bring a photo ID and a current utility bill or rent receipt"
